 paths\n- excludes the unmerged Paper 1 report and Paper 1 INDEX registration, and preserves `task/1743-p1-semantic-kg-final-report` unchanged\n\n## Production authority\n\nThe report remains bound to the terminal Paper 4 production authority:\n\n- `origin/main @ 6babc32cdfc4bae34b8ef421efa7d09d8f68f87f`\n- tree `caf79e6f1225c62f9c47769a28ddc364ceddd5f9`\n- parent #1771; serial children #1772–#1777; merged PRs #1778–#1783\n- all six documented reviewed-head trees equal their merge trees\n\nThe report preserves QuestionPart-grained approval, actual QP/MS pixel inspection as a hard semantic gate, candidate/abstain isolation, raw-byte custody, deterministic exact-main replay, rollback, and the distinction between substantive PASS and infrastructure-only or skipped CI states.\n\n## Key metrics\n\n- 480 active Questions and 1,317 QuestionParts\n- 967 score-owning and 350 instruction-only parts\n- 454 approved / 26 candidate Question dispositions\n- 767 approved / 199 candidate / 351 abstain part statuses\n- 1,458 ProcedureInstances and 3,168 steps\n- 97 canonical alternative branches\n- 17 terminal artifacts totaling 22,538,286 bytes\n- 16 terminal hard-boundary counters at zero\n- 1,716 authenticated active physical image refs with zero unreadable/missing/mismatched refs\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run quality:report-index` — PASS; one report added, zero violations\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD` — PASS\n- exact diff guard — PASS; only the report and `docs/reports/INDEX.md`\n- report blob provenance — PASS; original authored blob `8fa5d82e88a20b9d9b6fb22ea5ab069580988043` in `87bf5e2b060bc02a9b38244142fc79a5491a5eca`; current reviewed report blob `8377f0d26225c583e3d24f658f883ff22e1882b3`; the difference is only the reviewed §18 immutable-authority pinning repair in `29c3aebb4a8781fd5553a621d272461d96e2a823`\n- focused artifact-table validation — PASS; 17/17 exact paths, byte lengths, and SHA-256 values; 22,538,286 total bytes\n- focused report-path validation — PASS; 25/25 referenced repository paths resolve in the documented authority tree\n- focused GitHub-link validation — PASS; issue, PR, closeout comment, review, and review-thread anchors resolve\n- reviewed-head/merge-tree equality — PASS for all six production PRs\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONPATH=scripts/vlm python3 scripts/vlm/issue_1777_p4_terminal_reconciliation.py --check` — deterministic rebuild and active/terminal/rollback replay PASS\n- `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1777_p4_terminal_reconciliation.test.py` — 16/16 PASS\n- post-commit AO preflight — clean worktree; report guard and maintainability ratchet healthy; only the expected pre-push no-upstream warning\n\n## Scope and custody boundaries\n\n- used the existing root worktree only; no worktree was created\n- no P4 semantic artifacts, code, tests, manifests, structural authority, or historical bytes changed\n- no Paper 1 report or INDEX entry is included\n- authorized remote-write boundary: branch push, PR creation, PR-description update, review replies/reviews, and review-thread resolution only; no remote/public/production data write occurred\n- no issue was reopened, closed, edited, relabeled, or otherwise mutated\n- merge remains gated on fresh independent exact-head review after this metadata repair; this worker does not merge\n\nHistorical context only: Closes #1771. Issue #1771 and children #1772–#1777 are already closed/completed; this reference is for publication traceability and does not reopen or alter their state.","created_at":"2026-07-30T03:07:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-30T04:30:21Z","closed_at":"2026-07-30T04:17:57Z","merged_at":"2026-07-30T04:17:57Z","merge_commit_sha":"ea2a4ffd555acc83e5dbfc605d3c5db490c46e2b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1784/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/r